{
  "ir_version": 5,
  "title": "Energy Platform — Landing",
  "root": {
    "type": "page",
    "id": "page",
    "title": null,
    "default_row_gap": "1.5rem",
    "default_column_gap": "1.5rem",
    "default_page_padding": "0",
    "default_max_width": "72rem",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "hero",
        "id": "hero",
        "eyebrow": "RUBIX OS",
        "title": "Your buildings, in one living dashboard",
        "subtitle": "Energy, water, and HVAC telemetry — from sensor to insight — on pages you build yourself, no code required.",
        "style": { "gradient": "dusk", "radius": "xl", "shadow": "lg", "spacing": "2xl" },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "cta-primary",
            "label": "Start building",
            "href": "/builder/new",
            "variant": "solid",
            "size": "lg",
            "style": { "shadow": "md" }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "cta-secondary",
            "label": "View a live demo",
            "href": "/demo",
            "variant": "outline",
            "size": "lg"
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "section",
        "id": "kpis",
        "title": "At a glance",
        "subtitle": "Live across every connected site",
        "level": 2,
        "style": { "background": "subtle", "radius": "xl", "spacing": "lg" },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "row",
            "id": "kpi-row",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "col",
                "span": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "kpi",
                    "id": "kpi-power",
                    "label": "Total load",
                    "format": "number",
                    "unit_symbol": "kW",
                    "source": { "type": "static", "points": [[0, 1284.0]] }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "col",
                "span": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "kpi",
                    "id": "kpi-water",
                    "label": "Water flow",
                    "format": "number",
                    "unit_symbol": "L/s",
                    "source": { "type": "static", "points": [[0, 47.3]] }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "col",
                "span": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "kpi",
                    "id": "kpi-temp",
                    "label": "Avg indoor",
                    "format": "number",
                    "unit_symbol": "°C",
                    "source": { "type": "static", "points": [[0, 21.6]] }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "col",
                "span": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "kpi",
                    "id": "kpi-sites",
                    "label": "Sites online",
                    "format": "number",
                    "source": { "type": "static", "points": [[0, 38.0]] }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "section",
        "id": "trend",
        "title": "Demand over the week",
        "level": 2,
        "style": { "surface": "raised", "radius": "xl", "spacing": "lg", "shadow": "sm" },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "chart",
            "id": "demand-chart",
            "title": "Site A — total load",
            "kind": "area",
            "sources": [],
            "series": [
              {
                "label": "kW",
                "points": [
                  [0, 920.0], [1, 1010.0], [2, 1180.0], [3, 1320.0],
                  [4, 1240.0], [5, 1090.0], [6, 980.0]
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },

      {
        "type": "row",
        "id": "feature-row",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "col",
            "span": 7,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "card",
                "id": "story-card",
                "style": { "radius": "xl", "spacing": "lg", "shadow": "sm" },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "rich_text",
                    "id": "story",
                    "value": "## Build pages, not just charts\n\nDrop a **hero**, stack **sections**, add an **image**, and wire **KPIs** to live telemetry — all in the same canvas. Style every block with theme tokens so light and dark stay consistent.\n\n- Gradient and surface backgrounds\n- Editorial typography and spacing\n- Call-to-action buttons that link anywhere\n\nRead the [builder guide](/docs/builder) to go further."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "col",
            "span": 5,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "image",
                "id": "feature-img",
                "src": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473341304170-971dccb5ac1e?w=900&q=80",
                "alt": "Solar panels at dusk",
                "aspect": "video",
                "fit": "cover",
                "caption": "Site A · rooftop array",
                "style": { "radius": "xl", "shadow": "md" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },

      { "type": "spacer", "id": "gap-1", "size": "lg" },

      {
        "type": "hero",
        "id": "cta-band",
        "title": "Ready to see your sites this way?",
        "subtitle": "Spin up a page in minutes.",
        "style": { "background": "leaf", "radius": "xl", "spacing": "xl" },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "cta-final",
            "label": "Create your first page",
            "href": "/builder/new",
            "variant": "solid",
            "size": "lg"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
